  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "proto: Add check for valid value_pos and name_pos",
  "description": "Check if value_pos is after end of the buffer and set it to end\nof buffer if it is. In this case the buffer has no value to show,\nbut this is a corner case and should be ok.\n\nCheck if name_pos is at the end of the buffer to be truncated,\nand put trunc_str at the beginning if it's no room at the end.\n\nFixes #20613",
