          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 2609616437,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "It's unfortunate that we don't have the trace to show exactly what happened, because I don't think we have any (http) field names being > 240 bytes. It would be interesting to know the case.\n\nI don't know if changing this should matter much. The only difference is that value_pos will point to the beginning (giving the whole representation as a value) instead of value_pos point to the end (nothing as a value). In this case I think empty value is more correct because the value has been truncated out of the representation string.",
          "author": {
            "id": 4753670,
            "username": "stigbjorlykke",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Stig Bjørlykke",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/905aafc6b50e246885f5ea9273a9dc4f22e2658b71f9a1b551b797082bec3f80?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/stigbjorlykke"
          },
          "created_at": "2025-07-07T20:24:44.689Z",
