        {
          "id": 2609793350,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "The original non fuzzed capture has some headers, like a Location with several queries, that are greater than 240. It would take some pretty (un) lucky fuzzing to change that into something that wouldn't have illegal characters for a header and still get added there.",
