          "id": 2640082832,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "To complete the investigation. The failing field is http.location where the header \"Location\" is also found in the value after byte 240. The http dissector uses case insensitive match for the header, but the logic to find where to put the truncated mark does not. The failing case has header \"LocatioN:\", which is why we got the case. The merged fix is good.\n\n```\nLocatioN: http://login03.swisscom-eurospot.com/sw8tch.php?LogID=141186347&NASID=HNL284334&Lfn3RL=https%3A%2F%2Fclblgn.swisscom-eurospot.com%3A443%2FgoforN%2FHtmlLoginReq6est&NASIP=clblgn.swisscom-eurospot.com&CallerID=00-AE-35-6C-A4-34&CalledID3&CustIP=192.168.50.134&ESSID=&Location=&UserID=AQ%2F528312&RadiusReply=Bad+iassword\n```",
